==English==

===Etymology===
From {{w|William Horlick}}, founder. Term extended as euphemism for {{m|en|bollocks||mess}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-Horlicks.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|Horlickses}}

# {{surname|en}}
